  "content": "\n\n<h1>Uma Little Maid</h1>\n<p>這是一款 Minecraft 模組，為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/umapyoi\" rel=\"nofollow\">Umapyoi</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/touhou-little-maid\" rel=\"nofollow\">Touhou Little Maid</a> 的擴充模組。</p>\n<h2>描述</h2>\n<p>此模組僅新增 1 項功能：可將 Umapyoi 的 Umamusume 靈魂裝備給 TLM 的女僕。<br>\n女僕將變更為 &quot;Umamusume&quot; 並獲得強化，但大多數 Umamusume 的技能與特性將無法使用。</p>\n<h2>截圖</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e6cf1bf81994645d9f2087cd05707c6a9bf0a53.png\" alt=\"ScreenShot\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2e71a8d0540491e955cc799f8b4ef34d335166f6.png\" alt=\"ScreenShot\"></p>\n<h2>致謝</h2>\n<p>Cygames：推出 Umamusume 計畫。<br>\nTartaricAcid：製作 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/touhou-little-maid\" rel=\"nofollow\">Touhou Little Maid</a>。</p>",
